lity is a big issue. So likely we should shift to C. Provide reasoning: D's missing adaptability and feedback orientation, plus behavioral concerns, outweigh strengths. So we will change vote to Candidate C.\n\nWe must include explicit facts: D's hot temper, know-it-all, arrogance, weak leadership, responsibility, problem solving, concentration, responds adequately to unexpected events. C's 100% reliability, quick correct decisions, positive crew atmosphere, calm in crisis, excellent attention skills. Also note that D's adaptability unknown, which is a safety-critical gap.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: I agree with Agent 1 and 3, shift to C, explain why.\n\nMetadata: vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
